{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And he instructs.</b> And HaShem has already instructed the sower and the scatterer, and taught him how to act." "And the meaning of <b>for judgment</b> is like 'according to their number, according to judgment' (Numbers 29:32), to act according to custom, and likewise 'his Elohim instructs him.'"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:41.642359223Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}